        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> 1 Reiatsu Point<br /><strong>Range</strong> 30 feet, one creature</p><hr /><p>Attempt to <strong>counteract</strong> one ongoing magical effect, stance, aura, or release state affecting the target. Your counteract check uses your Reiatsu DC's proficiency and key attribute; your counteract rank is <strong>half your level, rounded up</strong>.</p><p>A <strong>release state</strong> &mdash; Shikai, Bankai, Resurrecci&oacute;n, Segunda Etapa, Vollst&auml;ndig, a Barbarian's Rage, a Magus's Arcane Cascade, or any comparable ongoing self-buff &mdash; is not ended outright but <strong>suppressed until the end of the target's next turn</strong>, and the target can't re-enter it during that time.</p>"
